<main id="top">
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="hero-main">
      <h1>Mingjun Wang</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Ph.D. Student · Department of Computer Science and Engineering · The Chinese University of Hong Kong</p>
      <p class="tagline">LLM4EDA / AI4EDA <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> 3D IC</p>
      <p class="hero-bio">
        I develop learning methods and design flows for integrated circuits, connecting circuit representation learning and LLM-based automation with 3D physical implementation. My work spans early-stage timing prediction, RTL-to-GDS flows, and efficient fault simulation.
      </p>
